    "chunk_text": "SriLankan Airlines scores a Slam Dunk at the Annual MSBA League Tournament\n\nSriLankan Airlines\u2019 basketball team scored a slam dunk at the 33rd Annual MSBA League Tournament, clinching victory in a thrilling final against DFCC Bank with a score of 60\u201352. The win is a testament to the team\u2019s talent, dedication and sportsmanship, with players representing divisions across the airline. First Officer Rayan Jayaratna was named Most Valuable Player of the tournament.\n\nThe team also included Sanjaya Wanasekara from Flight Operations; Don Ramanayake, Luke Perera, Shalin Casiechetty, and Shavitha De Silva from Engineering; and Aaron Gomes, Andre Jayakody, Buddhi Chathushanka, Dihan Wijesinghe, Gene De Zilva, and Maleesha Tilakaratne from Inflight Services. Team Manager Tilak Tillakaratne provided leadership and support, while coaches Hiran Wijesuriya and Isuru Perera guided the team with strategy and commitment that proved pivotal to this championship win.\n\nHayleys sustains growth momentum, delivering Profit Before Tax of Rs. 13.33 bn in first half of 2025/26\n\nIMF comment related to 2026 Budget helps shore- up bourse\u2019s fortunes\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
