    "md5": "e16e2832b7cde8ed1c008b6b75b54c3b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1317,
    "chunk_text": "SMB Finance PLC conducts \u2018Light for Learning\u2019 to empower underprivileged children\n\nSMB Finance PLC through one of its innovative corporate social responsibility initiatives called \u201cLight for Learning\u201d aimed at empowering under privileged children in Sri Lanka, donated complete set of school supplies including school bags, lunch boxes, water bottles, school books, stationery and other essential school supplies to all children studying at Sri Gunananda Vidyalaya, Colombo 13.\n\nSMB Finance PLC embraced the spirit of sustainability by sharing its prosperity to nurture the next generation by empowering young minds through education.\n\nAddressing the event, the Executive Director/ Chief Executive Officer of SMB Finance PLC, Supul Wijesinghe stated \u201cAs a responsible financial institution in Sri Lanka, we believe our role extends beyond business \u2014 it includes giving back to society. This initiative of our Chairman reiterates the continuous commitment of SMB Finance PLC to empower young learners and create a lasting social value\u201d.\n\nD & R Exports chairperson recognised as \u2018Legendary Woman of the Year\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
