    "md5": "e18fe303fe3e663970f695fec2f41d11",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 933,
    "chunk_text": "SL entrepreneur Sammoon recognised among Global Influential Women in Paris\n\nEntrepreneur Sarrah Sammoon has been recognised in Paris as one of the \u2018Influential Women of the World\u2019 for her impactful work in global mobility. The award, judged on measurable societal contribution, was presented at a ceremony held at the Ritz Paris.\n\nReflecting on the honour, Sammoon connected it directly to her life\u2019s mission. \u201cMy work is about bridging the Global North and South, building dignified pathways for people and capital to move responsibly,\u201d she stated.\n\nWith three decades of experience, she champions a philosophy that \u2018opportunity without meaning is incomplete,\u2019 guiding clients to pursue prosperity and purpose across borders.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
