    "md5": "bf074f3903ba9a45cb8101e9e109e9f8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1189,
    "chunk_text": "D & R Exports chairperson recognised as \u2018Legendary Woman of the Year\u2019\n\nManel Rajkumar, Chairperson of D & R Exports (Pvt) Ltd, has been awarded the \u2018Legendary Woman of the Year\u2019 (Large-Scale Category) at the Women Legend Awards 2025.\n\nThe company, a established player in Sri Lanka\u2019s food and beverage sector, began its operations in 1993. It expanded into international markets in 2002 and now exports a diverse range of products including canned fish, spices, ready-to-eat meals, and tea to destinations across Asia, Europe, and the Middle East.\n\nAll products are manufactured at the company\u2019s own facilities, adhering to stringent local and international quality standards. This award recognises a business built over three decades on a foundation of quality and safety.\n\n\u201cThis award is a testament to our team\u2019s dedication and our customers\u2019 trust,\u201d Rajkumar stated after the ceremony.\n\nSMB Finance PLC conducts \u2018Light for Learning\u2019 to empower underprivileged children\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
