    "chunk_text": "Agro Harvest Cultivation secures major Dubai order\n\nAgro Harvest Cultivation (Pvt) Ltd has become the first Sri Lankan company to export vermicompost fertilizer, securing a 500-ton order from the State of Dubai.\n\nThe company\u2019s new production facility in Matale, equipped with modern machinery, produces organic fertilizer compliant with international standards. This breakthrough has also attracted strong interest from several European countries, with negotiations underway to expand exports to China.\n\nThe company has obtained all necessary approvals from relevant national authorities for its international shipments.\n\nNalaka Silva, a senior representative of Agro Harvest Cultivation, said, \u201cMany countries have fully transitioned to organic agriculture, and even India now produces over 50% of its crops using organic fertilizers. In this context, we are proud to have successfully implemented a process which provides a wide range of products and services aimed at supporting both local and international agricultural development.\n\nSMB Finance PLC conducts \u2018Light for Learning\u2019 to empower underprivileged children\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
