    "description": "Sri Lanka named GCM Champion Country for leadership in migration governance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sri-Lanka-named-GCM-Champion-Country-for-leadership-in-migration-governance/56-784395",
    "lang": "en",
