    "chunk_size_bytes": 1562,
    "chunk_text": "Sysco LABS wins Gold at SLIM Brand Excellence Awards 2025\n\n[17th November 2025]: Sysco LABS, the Global Innovation Center for Sysco Corporation (NYSE: SYY), the world\u2019s largest foodservice company, was honored with the Gold Award in the \u201cExport Brand of the Year\u201d category at the SLIM Brand Excellence Awards 2025.\n\nThis marks Sysco LABS\u2019 first-ever submission to the prestigious awards, making it a remarkable achievement as the only company from Sri Lanka\u2019s IT industry recognized among leading names in the country\u2019s marketing landscape.\n\nHeld recently, the SLIM Brand Excellence Awards brought together top marketers and corporate leaders to celebrate excellence in marketing innovation, brand building, and business impact. Sysco LABS\u2019 win solidifies its evolution from a fledgling start-up to its current state as Sri Lanka\u2019s premier US technology corporate and as a technology brand that continues to power Sysco\u2019s global foodservice ecosystem while building a strong export presence from Sri Lanka.\n\nCommenting on the win, Gian De Rose, Director \u2013 Brand & Communications at Sysco LABS said: \u201cThis award reinforces the vision we\u2019ve been driving \u2014 to build a brand defined by excellence, relevance, purpose and meaningful impact. The work we do powers Sysco\u2019s recipe for growth, and this recognition energizes us to aim even higher.\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
