    "description": "Let\u2019s understand what a masterpiece is and how it originated",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/lets-understand-what-a-masterpiece-is-and-how-it-originated-2/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
