    "chunk_text": "David Pieris Group also acquired in 2022, Pulsar Shipping Agencies Ltd., the shipping arm of Expolanka Holdings PLC to expand its Logistics & Shipping Cluster into ship agency, husbandry services and marine logistics.\n\nLogicare, established by Ceylon Tea Brokers in 2017, has been providing state-of-the-art warehousing and logistics services. The sale marks Ceylon Tea Brokers\u2019 complete divestment from its logistics subsidiary as part of its strategy to focus on core tea broking and related services.\n\nThis strategic acquisition underscores the David Pieris Group\u2019s commitment to strengthening its presence in high-growth sectors and leveraging synergies across its diversified business portfolio.\n\nWith over four decades of business excellence, David Pieris Group stands as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s largest, most diversified and financially stable conglomerates, comprising 30+ companies across sectors such as automotive, financial services, logistics, shipping and marine Services, racing and leisure, real estate and renewable energy."
