    "description": "Unseen and undervalued: Sri Lanka\u2019s SMEs fight to stay in the game",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Unseen-and-undervalued-Sri-Lanka-s-SMEs-fight-to-stay-in-the-game/34-784503",
