    "description": "50 years of nourishing a nation: How Bairaha defined Sri Lanka\u2019s poultry industry",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/50-years-of-nourishing-a-nation-How-Bairaha-defined-Sri-Lanka-s-poultry-industry/4-784504",
