    "chunk_text": "The  Rajapaksa family party the SLPP got three seats including one on the national list. The SLPP national list seat was given to Namal Rajapaksa  who is also the party\u2019s national organizer. He is the only member of the Medamulana Rajapaksa family currently  in Parliament. Namal tries hard to revive the party and bring about another Rajapaksa  political renaissance . Namal who finished a poor fourth at the 2024 Presidential poll, seems to have set his sights on gaining victory at the 2029 presidential elections.\n\nThis article appears in the \u201cDBS Jeyaraj Column\u201dof the \u201cDaily Mirror\u201d dated 15th November 2025.It can be accessed here \u2013"
