    "chunk_text": "Adding to the sentiment, Mr. Roshan Mahanama, Founder of the Roshan Mahanama Trust, remarked, \u201cwe are truly grateful for the continuous support of LOLC Insurance, which allows the Trust to expand its initiatives across Sri Lanka, including raising breast cancer awareness through efforts such as our notable campaign, \u2018On Wednesdays We Wear Pink\u2019. This campaign encourages individuals to wear pink each Wednesday and practise TLC (Touch, Look, Check) for early detection. Together, through awareness, early detection, and community engagement, we can save lives and continue spreading hope.\u2019\u2019\n\nSLT Group continues 2025 profitability with strong Q3 and 9-Months results\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
