    "chunk_size_bytes": 1918,
    "chunk_text": "Likuid Spaces at One Galle Face \u00a0redefining premium workspaces in Colombo\n\nPerched high above the city within Shangri-La\u2019s One Galle Face Office Tower, Likuid Spaces stands as a reflection of Colombo\u2019s new era of work \u00a0one defined by creativity, connection, technology, and design excellence.\n\nFirst unveiled in mid-2023 with its exclusive Executive Wing spanning 10,000 square feet, Likuid Spaces at One Galle Face has become a sought-after destination for professionals and teams seeking more than just an office \u00a0a place where ideas grow and collaborations thrive. Likuid Spaces has now added a further 6,000 square feet in its newly completed Phase 2, bringing the total footprint to over 16,000 square feet of thoughtfully curated workspace.\n\nRecognized as one of the most automated workspaces in Sri Lanka, Likuid Spaces integrates intelligent access systems, digital booking technology, and seamless service management to create a workspace experience that is as effortless as it is inspiring.\n\nLocated within Colombo\u2019s most prestigious business and lifestyle address, Likuid Spaces fosters a vibrant professional community through curated events, creative partnerships, and a dedicated community management team \u00a0connecting founders, creators, and global businesses in one inspiring ecosystem.\n\nFounded by Shuaib Yusoof, Likuid Spaces has been instrumental in shaping Sri Lanka\u2019s modern workspace culture offering elevated environments that blend design, technology, and community for startups, creators, and multinational teams alike.\n\n\u201cLikuid Spaces has always been about more than just a workspace,\u201d said Shuaib Yusoof, Founder of Likuid Spaces. \u201cIt\u2019s about creating places where ideas grow, people connect, and businesses thrive. Our expansion at One Galle Face is another step toward that vision \u00a0a space that balances sophistication with creativity, right in the heart of Colombo.\u201d"
