    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank partners Colombo Motor Show 2025 as Official Banking & Leasing Partner\n\nSeylan Bank PLC has once again joined hands with the Colombo Motor Show as the Official Banking and Leasing Partner for the eighth consecutive year, continuing its long-standing association with the country\u2019s largest international motor and motor accessories exhibition. The highly anticipated Colombo Motor Show 2025 will take place on November 21st, 22nd, and 23rd at the Bandaranaike Memorial International Conference Hall (BMICH).\n\nRecognized as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most prominent automotive exhibitions, the event will feature over 200 trade stalls showcasing the latest in motor vehicles, accessories, spare parts, lubricants, tyres, batteries, and other supporting services. Organized by Asia Exhibition and Conventions (Pvt) Ltd for the 19th consecutive year, the exhibition continues to draw large crowds of vehicle enthusiasts and potential customers alike.\n\nAs the Official Banking and Leasing Partner, Seylan Bank will be present at the exhibition premises, offering visitors a comprehensive range of banking products and services. These will include attractive leasing facilities, inclusive of on-site lease evaluations, special rebates on processing fees and special interest rates. Further, Seylan Bank will offer credit card solutions, current and savings accounts, and a variety of digital banking services designed to make financial management more convenient for customers."
