    "description": "\u201cSome Scars Are Invisible \u2013 Speak Up, Seek Support\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Some-Scars-Are-Invisible-Speak-Up-Seek-Support/14-784624",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
