    "chunk_text": "The event is supported by Siraj Finance, Magic Mango, XESS Advertising, Pullman Creekside Deira City Centre (Official Hospitality Partner), Sri Lanka Bankers Association UAE and CASL UAE Chapter.\n\nThis powerful combination of exhibitors and supporters reflects the depth and diversity of Sri Lankan talent and enterprise.\n\n\u201cWe extend our appreciation to Pullman Creekside Deira City Centre for their exceptional partnership, and complimenting \u2018Chronicles of Ceylon\u2019 culinary festival, which beautifully brings together culinary and trade, hospitality and culture together,\u201d he added.\n\nThe Pavilion serves as the first major milestone in the SLBC\u2019s 35th anniversary calendar. It aims to: promote Sri Lanka\u2019s finest industries, create cross-border trade and investment opportunities, strengthen Sri Lanka\u2013UAE business relations, and provide a platform for Sri Lankan brands to explore Middle East market entry.\n\nExhibition hours are 21 November: 2 p.m.\u2013 10 p.m., 22 November: 10 a.m. \u2013 10 p.m. and 23 November: 10 a.m. \u2013 4 p.m."
