    "description": "UNICEF\u2019s \u2018Little Amaya \u2013 See Me, Hear Me\u2019 exhibit opens at Lotus Tower",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/UNICEF-s-Little-Amaya-See-Me-Hear-Me-exhibit-opens-at-Lotus-Tower/56-784650",
    "lang": "en",
