    "chunk_text": "OSC earns global recognition for sustainability\n\nThe Overseas School of Colombo (OSC) has been globally recognized as a leader in sustainable education. It was featured by UNESCO\u2019s Greening Education Partnership as one of only two exemplary Green Schools worldwide and renewed its prestigious Eco-Schools Green Flag accreditation.\n\nThe school\u2019s commitment was highlighted during a significant visit from Dr. Pramod Kumar Sharma of the Foundation for Environmental Education. Students showcased hands-on initiatives, including permaculture gardens harvested for a communal lunch, a bio-gas plant, and composting systems.\n\nThese accolades place OSC among an elite group within the 59,000 Eco-Schools network. Student achievements also include winning the international Young Reporters for the Environment competition and leading sessions at UN conferences, confirming OSC\u2019s role as a transformative force in embedding sustainability into education.\n\nNations Trust Bank partners with Colombo Fashion Week\u2019s Luxury Edit\n\nJanashakthi Life shines at SLIM NSA Awards 2025 showcasing its excellence in salesmanship\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
