    "chunk_size_bytes": 1508,
    "chunk_text": "Nations Trust Bank partners with Colombo Fashion Week\u2019s Luxury Edit\n\nNations Trust Bank PLC (NTB) has renewed its partnership with Colombo Fashion Week\u2019s (CFW) Luxury Edit: Couture + Trousseau 2025 as the Official Fashion Card, marking the ninth consecutive year of collaboration. The partnership underscores the Bank\u2019s commitment to curating exceptional lifestyle experiences for its Cardmembers.\n\nThis year\u2019s collaboration offers select Nations Trust Bank American Express\u00ae Cardmembers complementary access to attend the CFW event on 22nd & 23rd of November 2025. The event will feature curated exhibits of destination-wedding apparel, occasion wear, and bridal fashion offering an inspiring platform for South Asia\u2019s leading designers to showcase their work.\n\nSpeaking on the partnership, Niluka Gunatilake, Head of Cards at Nations Trust Bank PLC said, \u201cFor nearly a decade, Nations Trust Bank has been a proud partner of Colombo Fashion Week, a platform that continues to give prominence to global fashion trends showcased in Sri Lanka. Our partnership with the Luxury Edit: Couture + Trousseau allows us to cater to the passions and lifestyles of our Cardmembers, who value the artistry and craftsmanship behind high fashion.\u201d\n\nSri Lanka Insurance Life shines at SLIM National Sales Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
