    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Insurance Life shines at SLIM National Sales Awards 2025\n\nSri Lanka Insurance Life marked a momentous achievement at the prestigious SLIM National Sales Awards 2025, with its sales team being recognized for their unwavering dedication and excellence in the field.\n\nS A Joshua (SLIC Life Bancassurance \u2013 Cluster Manger) received the Silver Award in the Territory Manager Category, while. S J Prashanthi (SLIC Life Bancassurance \u2013 Area Manger) was honored with the Silver Award in the Sales Supervisor Category.\n\nThese accolades underscore the exceptional commitment, expertise, and leadership of these professionals, reflecting the high standards upheld by Sri Lanka Insurance Life in the competitive insurance industry. The awards further affirm the company\u2019s relentless pursuit of excellence and its pivotal role in shaping innovative and customer-focused solutions.\n\nThe SLIM National Sales Awards 2025, held on October 28, 2025, at the Monarch Imperial, celebrated top-performing sales professionals across various industries, making it a significant platform to honor outstanding achievements.\n\nRoyal Palms Beach recognised for \u2018exceptional sustainability\u2019 at NCP Awards 2025\n\nNations Trust Bank partners with Colombo Fashion Week\u2019s Luxury Edit\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
