    "chunk_text": "= We are a multiracial, multireligious society with far greater natural resources than Singapore. Unity is our missing ingredient.\n\n= English should serve as the working language for national integration and global competitiveness, while preserving mother tongues and faiths.\n\n= Citizens must reject destructive politics: strikes, agitation, and chaos only weaken the nation.\n\n= An independent, professionally regulated judiciary is vital for investors\u2019 confidence and public trust.\n\nSri Lanka can become a developed, independent nation. We need not align with any single geopolitical bloc; we can work with all for mutual benefit. But this requires pragmatism, unity, discipline, and clear-sighted leadership.\n\nLKY\u2019s lecture is essential viewing for both citizens and leaders.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
