    "description": "When the left fails to provide sufficient respite to \u201cthe tired, the poor, the hungry\u201d, they can be receptive to the  populist right.In Sri Lanka, the populist right uses the monks of the \u201cRajapaksa Nikaya\u201d as flamethrowers and Buddha statues are their weapons of choice.",
