    "description": "Time to bury the \u201c6% of GDP for Education\u201d slogan and manage with 2%",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Time-to-bury-the-6-of-GDP-for-Education-slogan-and-manage-with-2/4-784716",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
