    "date_str": "2025-11-24",
    "description": "Summoning of \u201cAruna\u201dEditor -in -chief Mahinda Ileperuma  for Questioning  Under the Parliamentary Privileges Act  on 24 Nov by the CID Regarding a Front Page News Item Published on 19 Nov Condemned by Sri Lanka Working Jpurnalist Association and Free Media Movement.",
