    "chunk_text": "Centrum Marine facilitates high value ALAM scholarships\n\nCentrum Marine Consultancy (Pvt) Ltd., a leader in Marine HR solutions in Sri Lanka, announced a major milestone in the country\u2019s maritime education landscape as five Sri Lankan students have secured the prestigious fully funded scholarship from Akademi Laut Malaysia (ALAM), Southeast Asia\u2019s leading maritime academy operated under the MISC Group a global leader in energy-related (oil & gas) maritime solutions with Its main shareholder being Petroliam Nasional Berhad (Petronas). This achievement reflects a breakthrough collaboration between Sri Lanka and Malaysia and marks an important step in strengthening the future of Sri Lankan youth aspiring to join the global maritime workforce.\n\nThe accomplishment follows Centrum Marine\u2019s appointment as the official student recruitment partner for ALAM in Sri Lanka, positioning the company at the forefront of facilitating international opportunities for aspiring seafarers.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
