    "md5": "9d88e309b95efd16a0bb2f1c54cd01db",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1657,
    "chunk_text": "Elephant House Ice Cream crowned Brand of the Year at SLIM Brand Excellence Awards 2025\n\nElephant House Ice Cream cemented its position as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most iconic brands by achieving the highest recognition at the SLIM Brand Excellence Awards 2025, where it was crowned Brand of the Year. The ceremony, held on 13th November, marked a defining moment for the brand as it reaffirmed its category leadership, deep-rooted consumer trust, and enduring legacy in Sri Lankan households.\n\nIn addition to securing the top honor of Brand of the Year, Elephant House Ice Cream delivered an exceptional performance across multiple award categories, winning Gold for Product Brand of the Year and Silver for Local Brand of the Year. This triple win underscores the brand\u2019s holistic strength, from product innovation and strategic marketing to consumer engagement and long-term brand equity. It reflects not only the brand\u2019s current market momentum but also the disciplined investments made to elevate quality, expand its product range, and strengthen emotional relevance among consumers nationwide.\n\nWith a heritage spanning over a century, Elephant House Ice Cream has remained synonymous with trusted family enjoyment, uncompromising quality, and category-defining innovation. Over the years, the brand has earned numerous accolades that stand as a testament to its timeless appeal, sustained performance, and pioneering role in shaping Sri Lanka\u2019s frozen confectionery landscape. Its latest achievement at this year\u2019s SLIM Brand Excellence Awards further strengthens its position as one of the country\u2019s most respected and admired consumer brands."
