    "md5": "94ed9c81ee9c5d843f9faa0b14d7ce4f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1586,
    "chunk_text": "For over 100 years, Browns Agriculture has been at the forefront of mechanising Sri Lanka\u2019s farming sector. This century-long legacy in agricultural innovation laid the foundation for the creation of the Browns Harvester, which today stands as the country\u2019s number one harvester, commanding an impressive 73% share of the national market. Designed and customised specifically for Sri Lankan paddy fields, the Browns Harvester is engineered to endure local soil conditions, varying terrains and climatic challenges, making it the best fit for Sri Lankan cultivators seeking a reliable and high-performing solution.\n\nBrowns\u2019 strong service commitment has been a defining force behind the Harvester\u2019s reputation, reinforced by Sri Lanka\u2019s most extensive after-sales and spare-parts network, ensuring farmers experience minimum downtime. Whenever a machine faces an issue, Browns\u2019 skilled technical teams travel directly to the farmer\u2019s doorstep or paddy field no matter how remote to restore operations quickly and reliably. This unwavering support has earned the trust of farming communities across the island. Season after season, as the Harvester proved its durability in real working conditions, Browns\u2019 field teams have stood beside farmers, listening to their challenges, working knee-deep in muddy fields, and strengthening engagement through brand activations and digital platforms. Today, this exceptional service ecosystem has made the Browns Harvester synonymous with value, dependability and long-lasting performance in both urban and rural farming communities."
